{"game":"Memory of Goddess (NKS)","id":"story-dorothy","title":"RECORD #04 MY OWN HOLY PLACE","group":"Story","count":31,"sections":[{"type":"facts","items":[["Plays in",[{"page":"stages-mog-2","label":"Military Base - II (M.O.G.)"}]],["Play as",[{"page":"char-2","label":"Dorothy"}]],["Carrying",[{"img":"nks_item_field_20","caption":"Parasol","size":"small"}]]]},{"type":"table","columns":["Speaker","Line"],"rows":[["",{"img":"nks_sbg_05","size":"large"}],["",{"b":"RECORD #04\nMY OWN HOLY PLACE"}],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c233","caption":"Dorothy","size":"small"},"Are you feeling better?"],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c220","caption":"Snow White","size":"small"},"Yes, much better."],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c220","caption":"Snow White","size":"small"},"It's awfully hot out here, though."],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c233","caption":"Dorothy","size":"small"},"It is. The heat bounces off the asphalt."],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c220","caption":"Snow White","size":"small"},"Do you always carry an umbrella, Dorothy?"],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c233","caption":"Dorothy","size":"small"},"Not all the time, but I try to as often as possible."],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c220","caption":"Snow White","size":"small"},"Would you like me to make one for you?"],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c233","caption":"Dorothy","size":"small"},"What? An umbrella?"],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c220","caption":"Snow White","size":"small"},"No. Something else to block out the sunlight."],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c220","caption":"Snow White","size":"small"},"I could make a device that you wouldn't have to hold."],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c233","caption":"Dorothy","size":"small"},"No, that's okay."],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c233","caption":"Dorothy","size":"small"},"I like the sunlight."],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c220","caption":"Snow White","size":"small"},"Huh? How come you carry an umbrella, then?"],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c233","caption":"Dorothy","size":"small"},"It's a bit hard to explain."],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c233","caption":"Dorothy","size":"small"},"In these times, if you eschew carrying a weapon"],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c233","caption":"Dorothy","size":"small"},"in favor of casually sauntering under the sunlight with an umbrella,"],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c233","caption":"Dorothy","size":"small"},"I feel it gives you a unique air about you."],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c220","caption":"Snow White","size":"small"},"Hmm... I guess it makes you feel extravagant."],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c233","caption":"Dorothy","size":"small"},"Hehe, yeah, something like that perhaps."],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c233","caption":"Dorothy","size":"small"},"..."],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c233","caption":"Dorothy","size":"small"},"Snow White..."],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c233","caption":"Dorothy","size":"small"},"When did taking a walk in the sun become a luxury?"],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c220","caption":"Snow White","size":"small"},"... Uh."],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c233","caption":"Dorothy","size":"small"},"I guess what I'm trying to say is..."],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c233","caption":"Dorothy","size":"small"},"I want to go back."],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c233","caption":"Dorothy","size":"small"},"Back when these things were part of everyday life, and not a luxury."],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c233","caption":"Dorothy","size":"small"},"That's why I carry this umbrella around with me."],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c220","caption":"Snow White","size":"small"},"... I see."],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c233","caption":"Dorothy","size":"small"},"This is a secret between you and me, okay?"],[{"img":"nks_characterdialog_c220","caption":"Snow White","size":"small"},"My lips are sealed!"]]}]}